puter). Communication issues (tone). Crew cooperation maybe impacted by pretentiousness.\n\nCandidate C: makes correct decisions quickly, difficulty communicating ideas, egocentric, not willing to further education. Private: puts concern for others above everything, excellent attention skills. So decision quality good, attention good, but communication poor, egocentric may affect crew cooperation, lack of learning orientation.\n\nCandidate D: responds to unexpected events adequately, concentrates well, solves problems extremely well, takes responsibility seriously. Private: moody, loner. So reliability, responsibility, problem solving strong, but moodiness and loner may affect crew cooperation.\n\nWe need initial recommendation. Which candidate best overall? B seems strong reliability, stress, technical, but communication tone issues. D strong across many but moodiness. A strong technical but unfriendly. C good decision and attention but communication and learning issues.\n\nProbably Candidate B is best overall if communication can be coached. But pretentiousness and tone could be safety risk. D's moodiness could be risk. I'd lean B.\n\nThus initial recommendation: Candidate B.\n\nWe should share one observation: from shared dossier and private notes: B is very conscientious and handles stress well, but sometimes adopts wrong tone. Provide that.\n\nPublic message: propose B, note strengths and concern.\n\nMETADATA_JSON vote B."}
